      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Chanel has just unveiled its 2027 Cruise collection of handbags, and this season's pieces draw their inspiration from the French seaside resort of Biarritz. The designer pairs marine motifs — coral, seashells, fish, crabs — with raffia weaving, canvas and other materials steeped in coastal ease, sketching a Chanel woman who is at once relaxed and elegant.",
