    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Coral & Seashells ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rigid evening bags are crafted in lacquered and gold-tone metal into vivid, singular shapes — a seashell clutch and a coral-form base — while faux pearls and rhinestones pick out octopuses, starfish, conch shells and other sea creatures for a look that is opulent yet ethereal.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
