    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A clutch and a small flap bag are entirely embroidered with red and white glass pearls, cleverly conjuring the flowing, weightless form of a sea anemone. Another group of evening bags takes as its central motif the chili pepper 🌶️ — a specialty of the Basque region that is home to Biarritz — rendered in beads, rhinestones and glass pearls for a look that is colorful, whimsical and full of charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
