      "text": "This group centers on raffia and natural wicker, both brimming with seaside spirit. Some pieces are embroidered with playful marine motifs — colorful fish, seashells, jellyfish, seahorses — while others weave shimmering gold and silver threads through the raffia, or render bold Basque stripes for maximum visual impact. The result overflows with coastal energy.",
